WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:04.977
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:05.247 --> 01:08.920
[Episode 3]

3
01:08.920 --> 01:10.480
The 25th day of the third lunar month,

4
01:10.480 --> 01:12.640
eight bowls of steamed balls with pine nuts,

5
01:12.640 --> 01:15.900
Ten taels.

6
01:18.280 --> 01:19.780
Master, your tea.

7
01:27.480 --> 01:30.180
Take a break and have some tea.

8
01:33.439 --> 01:37.219
I calculated everything you just read. Take a look.

9
01:38.480 --> 01:39.980
So fast?

10
01:46.840 --> 01:49.719
It smells nice, yet tasteless.

11
01:49.719 --> 01:51.239
It's not good.

12
01:51.239 --> 01:53.019
Rich aroma, delicate flavor,

13
01:53.719 --> 01:55.719
silky and mellow on the palate.

14
01:55.719 --> 01:59.060
This is Huiyuan Tea. A hundred taels per jin.

15
02:00.879 --> 02:04.260
They spared no expense to win over a goose like you.

16
02:06.159 --> 02:07.819
Are you listening?

17
02:58.400 --> 02:59.900
Someone, come.

18
03:04.759 --> 03:06.199
It's getting late.

19
03:06.199 --> 03:08.219
Escort her back to rest.

20
03:15.000 --> 03:19.659
See that she has a thicker quilt, lest she catches cold.

21
03:20.400 --> 03:23.379
Lady Jin.

22
03:24.000 --> 03:25.039
Lady Jin.

23
03:25.039 --> 03:27.840
A concubine may not lodge in her lord's chamber overnight.

24
03:27.840 --> 03:29.539
Let us help you back.

25
03:51.000 --> 03:53.639
Ying Tao!

26
03:53.639 --> 03:57.340
Fetch charcoal powder!

27
04:34.360 --> 04:36.060
Jin Bao Zhu!

28
04:38.079 --> 04:41.339
You...

29
04:44.399 --> 04:46.160
I finally figured it out.

30
04:46.160 --> 04:49.079
My hands would catch fire with all this rubbing.

31
04:49.079 --> 04:50.660
Is it so exaggerated?

32
04:55.959 --> 04:57.720
Master Yan, Lady Jin.

33
04:57.720 --> 05:00.540
Now that we've tallied the accounts,

34
05:01.360 --> 05:03.399
- shall we report back? - For what?

35
05:03.399 --> 05:06.945
No, it is time to settle our debts.

36
05:06.945 --> 05:10.040
[Lu Mansion]

37
05:10.040 --> 05:12.639
I am a younger member of the Xie family.

38
05:12.639 --> 05:14.399
I sent a visiting card the other day,

39
05:14.399 --> 05:16.839
specifically to borrow the book, Jingyue Works.

40
05:16.839 --> 05:19.779
I've been swamped lately, and I completely forgot.

41
05:20.399 --> 05:22.339
May I ask your name?

42
05:23.720 --> 05:26.399
High mountains we revere; great virtues we follow.

43
05:26.399 --> 05:27.399
[Song Jing Xing] That's where my name, Jing Xing,

44
05:27.399 --> 05:29.279
[Shen Man Yun's Adopted Son] comes from.

45
05:29.279 --> 05:32.959
I remember all young men of the Xie family bear one-character given names.

46
05:32.959 --> 05:34.319
My surname is Song.

47
05:34.319 --> 05:36.720
I was a distant relative of Lady Xie.

48
05:36.720 --> 05:38.639
I'm staying with the Xie family to study

49
05:38.639 --> 05:40.279
for next year's imperial physician exam.

50
05:40.279 --> 05:42.079
So you're just living under another's roof.

51
05:42.079 --> 05:44.040
How dare you call yourself a Xie family member!

52
05:44.040 --> 05:45.319
Imperial physician exam?

53
05:45.319 --> 05:47.819
You think much too highly of yourself.

54
05:49.959 --> 05:51.399
Why are you mocking him?

55
05:51.399 --> 05:52.959
He didn't lie.

56
05:52.959 --> 05:54.639
He is of humble origin.

57
05:54.639 --> 05:56.720
His diligence is praiseworthy.

58
05:56.720 --> 05:59.399
Let's go. Don't mind them.

59
05:59.399 --> 06:01.199
A family elder is sick.

60
06:01.199 --> 06:02.839
My healing art is shallow.

61
06:02.839 --> 06:05.759
I have no one else to turn to, so I came to beg the book from your manor.

62
06:05.759 --> 06:09.519
Please, Master Lu, show some mercy and grant me this favor.

63
06:09.519 --> 06:11.639
The Xie family has immense wealth.

64
06:11.639 --> 06:13.759
What kind of physician could they not afford?

65
06:13.759 --> 06:15.819
Since when is it your place to get involved?

66
06:17.639 --> 06:20.839
This book was written by the best physician, Zhang Jing Yue.

67
06:20.839 --> 06:23.959
Countless physicians exhausted their fortunes and connections for a copy,

68
06:23.959 --> 06:25.519
only to return empty-handed.

69
06:25.519 --> 06:27.759
You think you can just have it whenever you want?

70
06:27.759 --> 06:29.779
[Jingyue Works] You think it's as cheap as turnips?

71
06:33.720 --> 06:35.199
Forget it.

72
06:35.199 --> 06:40.079
If you can catch Xi's favorite fish today and make her smile,

73
06:40.079 --> 06:43.819
no need to borrow it, I'll give it to you outright.

74
06:44.720 --> 06:45.839
Good idea.

75
06:45.839 --> 06:47.600
Let him catch the fish.

76
06:47.600 --> 06:48.600
Make him catch fish!

77
06:48.600 --> 06:51.040
Lu Zi Yu, are you out of your mind?

78
06:51.040 --> 06:52.519
It's freezing cold. Do you want to freeze him to death?

79
06:52.519 --> 06:55.519
Xi, I'm not bullying him.

80
06:55.519 --> 06:57.759
He's willing to do it. Ask him yourself.

81
06:57.759 --> 06:59.259
Isn't that right?

82
07:00.279 --> 07:04.259
For Master Lu, if I may make Miss Xi smile, I would gladly do so.

83
07:06.639 --> 07:08.439
Wait, you...

84
07:08.439 --> 07:11.399
Why are you such a coward?

85
07:11.399 --> 07:15.399
Xi, he has to take off his boots and get in the water.

86
07:15.399 --> 07:17.319
It's improper for a young lady to stay here.

87
07:17.319 --> 07:19.319
Why don't you take a stroll in the garden?

88
07:19.319 --> 07:20.860
I'll send for you when it's done.

89
07:23.319 --> 07:26.079
What? Are you really taking them off?

90
07:26.079 --> 07:28.383
- He's really taking them off! - Look at him!

91
07:28.383 --> 07:31.079
- Look! - That one! Go more to that side!

92
07:31.079 --> 07:33.439
- Yes! - Over there! See it?

93
07:33.439 --> 07:34.939
It's right there!

94
07:36.800 --> 07:38.240
Exactly! What are you catching?

95
07:38.240 --> 07:40.360
- No, not that one! - Do you even know how to catch fish?

96
07:40.360 --> 07:42.420
- That one! - Hurry up!

97
07:43.399 --> 07:44.759
- Go by yourself! - Come on!

98
07:44.759 --> 07:45.759
I'll just wait right here.

99
07:45.759 --> 07:47.079
- Go by yourself! - Get moving!

100
07:47.079 --> 07:48.519
I'm waiting right here.

101
07:48.519 --> 07:51.199
When you were fooling around and piling up debts,

102
07:51.199 --> 07:52.639
why weren't you embarrassed then?

103
07:52.639 --> 07:54.160
Now that we're at their doorstep, you care about your pride?

104
07:54.160 --> 07:55.319
The world stretches as wide as rivers and seas.

105
07:55.319 --> 07:56.639
All you behold is but a single scoop.

106
07:56.639 --> 07:58.639
What can you possibly know?

107
07:58.639 --> 08:00.199
Why should I know?

108
08:00.199 --> 08:02.199
You prate lofty nonsense all day,

109
08:02.199 --> 08:03.600
yet earn not a copper.

110
08:03.600 --> 08:05.459
What a spoilsport.

111
08:06.199 --> 08:07.720
- Let's go! - I'm not going.

112
08:07.720 --> 08:08.839
Are you going or not?

113
08:08.839 --> 08:10.339
You go.

114
08:12.759 --> 08:14.339
You're so strong!

115
08:20.079 --> 08:21.720
Tell your master

116
08:21.720 --> 08:24.279
that Xie Yan, son of the former Director

117
08:24.279 --> 08:27.759
of the Ministry of Revenue's Canal Shipping Bureau,

118
08:27.759 --> 08:37.279
comes to claim his debt.

119
08:38.240 --> 08:39.740
Master.

120
08:47.639 --> 08:51.159
When the clerk of Shuyu Pavilion came for payment, I checked the ledger carefully.

121
08:51.159 --> 08:52.279
For half a year,

122
08:52.279 --> 08:53.519
- you ran up at least 70 to 80 charges, - Xi.

123
08:53.519 --> 08:54.679
all charged

124
08:54.679 --> 08:57.039
to my husband.

125
08:57.039 --> 08:59.399
I calculated them item by item.

126
08:59.399 --> 09:03.039
You all owe a total of 1,612 taels.

127
09:03.039 --> 09:04.820
Here is the rough draft I drew up.

128
09:06.679 --> 09:10.120
Sister-in-law, what on earth did you write here?

129
09:10.120 --> 09:11.559
Pardon my ignorance,

130
09:11.559 --> 09:13.360
but I can't make heads or tails of this.

131
09:13.360 --> 09:15.259
It's fine. I can't read either.

132
09:16.279 --> 09:17.279
Who are you anyway?

133
09:17.279 --> 09:19.039
Why are you calling me sister-in-law?

134
09:19.039 --> 09:21.940
I... I'm your husband's sister.

135
09:23.039 --> 09:24.919
You have a sister?

136
09:24.919 --> 09:26.419
Just a concubine-born sister.

137
09:32.519 --> 09:35.039
These scribbles look like chicken scratch.

138
09:35.039 --> 09:37.039
There aren't even any names on here.

139
09:37.039 --> 09:38.799
How can we accept this?

140
09:38.799 --> 09:40.159
The ledger of Shuyu Pavilion

141
09:40.159 --> 09:42.679
bears clear records of dates, hours, wine, food and tea treats.

142
09:42.679 --> 09:44.559
It's even stamped with a red seal.

143
09:44.559 --> 09:47.480
That's how proper businesses keep accounts.

144
09:47.480 --> 09:50.480
I only recognize bills from Shuyu Pavilion.

145
09:50.480 --> 09:52.045
- Exactly! - We won't

146
09:52.045 --> 09:53.317
accept bills from anywhere else.

147
09:53.317 --> 09:54.578
How could we accept this?

148
09:54.578 --> 09:56.078
We can't.

149
09:57.120 --> 09:59.279
I brought their ledger too.

150
09:59.279 --> 10:02.799
Not only that, I also brought proof of your tabs.

151
10:02.799 --> 10:05.240
If the evidence is solid, will you accept it?

152
10:05.240 --> 10:06.519
I will.

153
10:06.519 --> 10:08.159
Fine.

154
10:08.159 --> 10:10.279
Draw up a written pledge for me first, then I shall show you.

155
10:10.279 --> 10:12.575
Otherwise, I'm going to the magistrate.

156
10:12.575 --> 10:13.575
The magistrate?

157
10:13.575 --> 10:15.759
- Report to the magistrate? - That's his own father!

158
10:15.759 --> 10:17.399
Report to the magistrate?

159
10:17.399 --> 10:20.299
Fine, I'll have someone write it.

160
10:23.279 --> 10:25.559
Call that guy over.

161
10:25.559 --> 10:27.059
Understood.

162
10:34.879 --> 10:36.379
Hurry up!

163
10:39.519 --> 10:42.019
Master Lu, is this the one?

164
10:48.159 --> 10:51.019
I summoned you to write, not to fish!

165
10:52.399 --> 10:54.240
Draft a written pledge quickly.

166
10:54.240 --> 10:55.559
Don't keep my guest waiting.

167
10:55.559 --> 10:57.696
[Jingyue Works]

168
10:59.759 --> 11:01.259
Yes.

169
11:12.319 --> 11:17.539
Write swiftly and well, and you shall be richly rewarded.

170
11:18.519 --> 11:20.019
Yes.

171
11:31.000 --> 11:32.500
Master Lu.

172
11:39.989 --> 11:41.504
[Written Pledge]

173
11:51.980 --> 11:55.039
[Puji Temple Ordination Certificate]

174
11:55.039 --> 11:57.039
What kind of proof is this?

175
11:57.039 --> 12:00.879
On the 11th day of the third lunar month, he copied scriptures at Puji Temple.

176
12:00.879 --> 12:03.799
This is the temple's ordination certificate, sealed by the abbot.

177
12:03.799 --> 12:06.159
[Puji Temple] This is the ordination certificate,

178
12:06.159 --> 12:08.059
[Guest Monk, the 11th Day of the Third Month] sealed by the abbot.

179
12:09.759 --> 12:11.799
Remember this: on the 9th day of the sixth lunar month...

180
12:11.799 --> 12:12.919
[Medical Record] On the 9th day of the sixth lunar month,

181
12:12.919 --> 12:14.919
his old leg wound flared, confining him to bed.

182
12:14.919 --> 12:16.879
Here is the prescription written by the physician that day.

183
12:16.879 --> 12:19.519
Seventh lunar month, 23rd, he visited Imperial Hospital for a return consultation.

184
12:19.519 --> 12:21.000
[Imperial Hospital] This is the receipt from the hospital,

185
12:21.000 --> 12:23.039
[Patient: Xie Yan] signed by the imperial physician.

186
12:23.039 --> 12:24.759
My husband was absent then,

187
12:24.759 --> 12:27.039
yet the accounts bore his name.

188
12:27.039 --> 12:28.740
How do you explain that?

189
12:29.519 --> 12:31.059
What's the rush?

190
12:32.120 --> 12:35.419
I shall first examine Shuyu Pavilion's ledgers.

191
12:52.559 --> 12:54.399
Strange.

192
12:54.399 --> 12:58.779
None of the dates you spoke of are here.

193
13:03.000 --> 13:05.360
Could someone have torn them out?

194
13:05.360 --> 13:06.980
What nonsense!

195
13:15.360 --> 13:17.220
You dared to do it, yet refuse to own up to it?

196
13:20.399 --> 13:22.139
How ridiculous.

197
13:22.879 --> 13:24.519
Just own up to it.

198
13:24.519 --> 13:25.559
Exactly.

199
13:25.559 --> 13:27.059
You will not even confess it.

200
13:28.759 --> 13:31.299
Just admit it. It's fine.

201
13:36.080 --> 13:37.120
What's the big deal?

202
13:37.120 --> 13:38.899
You had to make a fool of yourself.

203
13:43.840 --> 13:45.519
Embarrassing, isn't it?

204
13:45.519 --> 13:47.639
Could it be that your husband cannot settle his debts?

205
13:47.639 --> 13:51.159
You secretly tore out those pages,

206
13:51.159 --> 13:54.960
hoping to extort payment from us on his behalf?

207
13:54.960 --> 13:56.879
That actually makes sense!

208
13:56.879 --> 13:58.620
That's definitely it!

209
14:00.679 --> 14:03.519
Then she may lay claim to any sum she pleases!

210
14:03.519 --> 14:05.039
She's got some nerve!

211
14:05.039 --> 14:06.639
Trying to extort us?

212
14:06.639 --> 14:08.240
Doesn't she know who we are?

213
14:08.240 --> 14:10.519
Exactly! Who do you think you are?

214
14:10.519 --> 14:12.320
She even dared to threaten reporting to the authorities!

215
14:12.320 --> 14:13.320
How insolent of her!

216
14:13.320 --> 14:14.720
Isn't she just trying to frame us?

217
14:14.720 --> 14:16.480
That's the thief crying "Stop thief!"

218
14:16.480 --> 14:18.539
What did we ever do to you?

219
14:24.039 --> 14:25.519
They were indeed torn out.

220
14:25.519 --> 14:27.360
No records remain of those days.

221
14:27.360 --> 14:28.639
Exactly.

222
14:28.639 --> 14:29.879
See?

223
14:29.879 --> 14:32.399
Cheng Jiang is reasonable.

224
14:32.399 --> 14:36.179
Since there are no records, there's no need to settle the accounts, no?

225
14:38.159 --> 14:41.200
Cheng Jiang, they may leave?

226
14:41.200 --> 14:42.519
Let's leave.

227
14:42.519 --> 14:43.519
Gentlemen, I'll walk you out.

228
14:43.519 --> 14:45.620
Fortunately, I have a decent memory.

229
14:46.919 --> 14:50.759
I kept track of everything when I checked the accounts for her.

230
14:50.759 --> 14:53.039
I will recite them now.

231
14:53.039 --> 14:55.220
Just have someone write them down.

232
14:56.480 --> 14:57.980
Cheng Jiang,

233
14:58.639 --> 15:01.279
it's not that I don't trust you,

234
15:01.279 --> 15:05.639
but if you get the numbers wrong, none of us would know, right?

235
15:05.639 --> 15:09.000
- Exactly. - Then summon a few more accountants.

236
15:09.000 --> 15:13.039
We can see if the numbers match the total.

237
15:13.039 --> 15:16.620
If they match, it proves I'm not making it up.

238
15:17.559 --> 15:22.519
Over such a trivial matter, why make such a fuss, Cheng Jiang?

239
15:22.519 --> 15:26.519
I am settling the accounts precisely to clear your name.

240
15:26.519 --> 15:29.620
Don't you understand my good intentions?

241
15:42.759 --> 15:45.399
Fetch a few clever accountants.

242
15:45.399 --> 15:48.259
Make sure to find errors in their figures.

243
15:48.919 --> 15:52.220
Refute these two, and they'll be handsomely rewarded.

244
15:52.879 --> 15:54.379
Understood.

245
15:57.879 --> 16:00.159
The 11th day of the third lunar month: four servings of Liu'an Tea,

246
16:00.159 --> 16:02.399
eight pots of apricot blossom wine, four bowls of silver fish soup.

247
16:02.399 --> 16:05.200
Entertainer Qing Lian performed, singing four verses of Silver Threads.

248
16:05.200 --> 16:06.240
Total: 56 taels.

249
16:06.240 --> 16:07.399
The 9th day of the lunar month:

250
16:07.399 --> 16:09.279
eight pine nut cakes, eight walnut pastries.

251
16:09.279 --> 16:11.759
Entertainer Qing Lian performed, singing two verses of Cleaving Jade.

252
16:11.759 --> 16:12.879
Total: 48 taels.

253
16:12.879 --> 16:14.039
The 23rd day of the seventh lunar month:

254
16:14.039 --> 16:16.559
three cups of Mengding tea, three bowls of fresh bamboo shoot soup.

255
16:16.559 --> 16:19.879
Entertainer Mei Ling performed, singing five verses of The Fifth Watch.

256
16:19.879 --> 16:21.879
Total: 64 taels.

257
16:21.879 --> 16:23.799
That is all.

258
16:23.799 --> 16:25.159
Well?

259
16:25.159 --> 16:29.620
Do the figures match the total or not?

260
16:30.240 --> 16:33.399
The 11th day of the third lunar month: eight pots of apricot blossom wine.

261
16:33.399 --> 16:35.879
Sixteen taels means two taels per pot.

262
16:35.879 --> 16:38.639
Yet as it stands, the wine costs one string of coins per pot.

263
16:38.639 --> 16:40.559
Four pots should only cost four taels.

264
16:40.559 --> 16:42.399
You overcharged by a full 12 taels!

265
16:42.399 --> 16:44.240
In the third and fourth lunar months, apricot blossoms are in full bloom.

266
16:44.240 --> 16:45.919
More people drink apricot blossom wine,

267
16:45.919 --> 16:47.639
yet apricot blossoms were scarce this year.

268
16:47.639 --> 16:49.159
Naturally, the price was higher.

269
16:49.159 --> 16:50.759
Now that it's cold, nobody drinks it,

270
16:50.759 --> 16:52.200
so it's gotten cheaper.

271
16:52.200 --> 16:54.679
No tea was ordered on the 9th day of the sixth lunar month.

272
16:54.679 --> 16:57.200
The courtesan asked four strings per verse, singing two verses.

273
16:57.200 --> 17:00.039
Snacks cost 32 taels, totaling 40.

274
17:00.039 --> 17:02.519
Where does this 48 taels come from?

275
17:02.519 --> 17:03.799
When you sit at a teahouse,

276
17:03.799 --> 17:05.200
you pay for the seats even if you don't drink.

277
17:05.200 --> 17:07.039
Did you expect to sit there for free?

278
17:07.039 --> 17:09.079
One tael per person, eight taels for eight people.

279
17:09.079 --> 17:10.160
It adds up perfectly.

280
17:10.160 --> 17:11.599
The 23rd day of the seventh lunar month:

281
17:11.599 --> 17:14.960
three servings of Mengding tea, four strings apiece, 12 taels total.

282
17:14.960 --> 17:18.000
Three bowls of bamboo shoot soup, two strings apiece, six taels total.

283
17:18.000 --> 17:20.599
Five verses sung by the courtesan cost 20 taels.

284
17:20.599 --> 17:24.279
That's 38 taels in total, not 64 taels!

285
17:24.279 --> 17:27.200
Mei Ling is Shuyu Pavilion's top courtesan.

286
17:27.200 --> 17:30.319
Could her songs possibly cost the same as Qing Lian's?

287
17:30.319 --> 17:32.759
She charges eight taels per verse.

288
17:32.759 --> 17:36.000
Five verses make 40 taels.

289
17:36.000 --> 17:38.920
Alas, no matter how well Mei Ling sings, her talent goes to waste.

290
17:38.920 --> 17:42.240
Someone has engaged Qing Lian for four to five months in succession.

291
17:42.240 --> 17:44.799
It seems Qing Lian is Master Lu's true darling.

292
17:44.799 --> 17:46.400
Cease these baseless accusations!

293
17:46.400 --> 17:49.000
Xi, Qing Lian has had a tragic life.

294
17:49.000 --> 17:50.359
I was merely helping her out.

295
17:50.359 --> 17:53.279
Enough! Helping her is no concern of mine.

296
17:53.279 --> 17:56.359
Accountant, keep questioning them! Why did you stop?

297
17:56.359 --> 17:58.240
I have finished verifying the figures.

298
17:58.240 --> 18:01.000
Master Xie's accounts are entirely correct.

299
18:01.000 --> 18:03.359
They match the total sum perfectly.

300
18:03.359 --> 18:05.359
How is that possible? How could an ordinary man...

301
18:05.359 --> 18:07.880
An ordinary man indeed could not.

302
18:07.880 --> 18:09.380
But I can.

303
18:16.720 --> 18:18.339
Xi!

304
18:19.119 --> 18:20.119
Pay up.

305
18:20.119 --> 18:21.599
Go ask them to repay you.

306
18:21.599 --> 18:23.000
I am not the only one indebted to you.

307
18:23.000 --> 18:25.000
You arranged every outing. Naturally, I demand you make restitution.

308
18:25.000 --> 18:27.599
As for their portion, go collect it yourself.

309
18:27.599 --> 18:30.079
This isn't a small sum.

310
18:30.079 --> 18:31.579
Give me some time to gather it.

311
18:39.920 --> 18:41.420
Three days.

312
18:42.119 --> 18:45.740
Three days hence, I shall repay every coin.

313
18:59.039 --> 19:00.599
A woman's virtue rests in poise and demeanor,

314
19:00.599 --> 19:02.579
grave and modest in bearing before others.

315
19:04.920 --> 19:06.740
Where does a man's virtue rest?

316
19:08.000 --> 19:09.759
In his heart.

317
19:09.759 --> 19:10.920
So in a cur's belly.

318
19:10.920 --> 19:11.920
Jin Bao Zhu.

319
19:11.920 --> 19:13.519
What?

320
19:13.519 --> 19:15.759
I spoke myself hoarse in your defense.

321
19:15.759 --> 19:17.519
So what if I jabbed at you a little?

322
19:17.519 --> 19:19.759
Besides, don't you know how to read?

323
19:19.759 --> 19:21.440
Why did you make me memorize the receipts?

324
19:21.440 --> 19:23.420
You just thought collecting debts was humiliating.

325
19:25.000 --> 19:26.500
Give me the written pledge.

326
19:39.039 --> 19:40.599
You've been tricked.

327
19:40.599 --> 19:43.079
There's neither signature nor fingerprint on this.

328
19:43.079 --> 19:44.759
He took advantage of your illiteracy to deceive you.

329
19:44.759 --> 19:48.259
You probably won't get this money back.

330
19:58.759 --> 20:00.920
It's fine. It's not your fault.

331
20:00.920 --> 20:03.400
Of course, it's not my fault!

332
20:03.400 --> 20:04.960
I don't need your pity.

333
20:04.960 --> 20:06.960
When they tricked me for being illiterate, you didn't defend me.

334
20:06.960 --> 20:08.279
You were the one supposed to check this in the first place.

335
20:08.279 --> 20:10.160
- Why didn't you look at it? - I'm looking at it now.

336
20:10.160 --> 20:12.640
You wipe your nose only when the mucus runs into your mouth?

337
20:12.640 --> 20:14.279
It's way too late!

338
20:14.279 --> 20:16.240
I recited the accounts for you just now.

339
20:16.240 --> 20:18.319
You've scolded me enough.

340
20:18.319 --> 20:19.819
What more do you want?

341
20:36.039 --> 20:39.319
I was mocked for clearing your troubles.

342
20:39.319 --> 20:41.000
You must make amends.

343
20:41.000 --> 20:44.339
That's only fair, right?

344
20:55.559 --> 20:57.319
- Jin Bao Zhu! - Go on!

345
20:57.319 --> 20:59.200
- Come here! - No, I'm not going!

346
20:59.200 --> 21:01.680
- Jin Bao Zhu! - Go on!

347
21:01.680 --> 21:03.180
I'll divorce you!

348
21:06.039 --> 21:09.339
Cheng Jiang, what are you doing here?

349
21:16.130 --> 21:17.990
Where is your shrewish wife?

350
21:17.990 --> 21:19.579
Did she plaster you to the ground?

351
21:21.421 --> 21:23.259
You're henpecked, huh?

352
21:24.440 --> 21:25.759
My apologies.

353
21:25.759 --> 21:26.839
It's all because of...

354
21:26.839 --> 21:28.339
You, get over here.

355
21:30.000 --> 21:32.079
That man is wholly to blame.

356
21:32.079 --> 21:33.940
He kept pestering me for that medical book.

357
21:35.759 --> 21:37.779
You scribbled gibberish!

358
21:38.559 --> 21:40.559
Watch this, Cheng Jiang.

359
21:40.559 --> 21:43.519
I'll kick him good for you.

360
21:43.519 --> 21:45.180
I'll kick you to death!

361
21:47.240 --> 21:49.799
How dare you play petty tricks on Cheng Jiang!

362
21:49.799 --> 21:52.839
Don't you know you and I are just ordinary folks?

363
21:52.839 --> 21:54.440
Is Cheng Jiang ordinary?

364
21:54.440 --> 21:55.960
No, he's not!

365
21:55.960 --> 21:59.660
He's the prodigy of Yangzhou, parading on horseback through the streets!

366
22:05.000 --> 22:06.500
Who hit me?

367
22:08.720 --> 22:10.539
- Who was that? - Me, you wretch!

368
22:12.960 --> 22:14.640
How dare you!

369
22:14.640 --> 22:17.220
I'm the son of the River Sub-Prefect!

370
22:18.240 --> 22:19.279
Men!

371
22:19.279 --> 22:21.079
- Yes! - Get her!

372
22:21.079 --> 22:22.579
Yes!

373
22:28.960 --> 22:29.960
You have no honor left.

374
22:29.960 --> 22:32.240
Why should I seek to shame you?

375
22:32.240 --> 22:34.720
No wonder my husband's sister looks down on you.

376
22:34.720 --> 22:36.519
Take a good look in the mirror!

377
22:36.519 --> 22:39.279
Spout nonsense to my husband again, and I'll beat you to death!

378
22:39.279 --> 22:40.880
And another thing!

379
22:40.880 --> 22:43.200
How dare you trick me!

380
22:43.200 --> 22:46.039
Sign and stamp your thumbprint right now!

381
22:46.039 --> 22:47.960
Sign it!

382
22:47.960 --> 22:49.599
Sign!

383
22:49.599 --> 22:51.279
Cheng Jiang, stop her!

384
22:51.279 --> 22:54.220
If she hits me again, I won't even be able to sign!

385
23:01.092 --> 23:03.960
[Written Pledge]

386
23:15.920 --> 23:17.420
Stamp your thumbprint!

387
23:21.153 --> 23:23.683
[Pledged by Lu Zi Yu]

388
23:33.119 --> 23:34.700
Be careful.

389
23:38.319 --> 23:40.039
I saw you the day of the tea ceremony.

390
23:40.039 --> 23:41.799
You felt the matriarch's pulse.

391
23:41.799 --> 23:43.980
Out of respect for her, I'm returning this to you.

392
23:47.000 --> 23:48.000
Thank you.

393
23:48.000 --> 23:50.819
Trick me again, and I'll beat you up too.

394
24:23.599 --> 24:25.180
It's snowing.

395
24:30.599 --> 24:32.759
Did you receive the betrothal gifts?

396
24:32.759 --> 24:34.119
Yes, I did.

397
24:34.119 --> 24:38.119
Yet most shall pass to my father's main wife and my younger brother.

398
24:38.119 --> 24:40.119
I could have fought to get them back for my mother,

399
24:40.119 --> 24:42.200
but I wanted her to learn a lesson.

400
24:42.200 --> 24:44.180
I shall never outwit a merchant.

401
24:45.279 --> 24:46.920
That's because you're too stupid.

402
24:46.920 --> 24:48.886
You idle with pampered youths all day,

403
24:48.886 --> 24:51.839
mocked and preyed upon.

404
24:51.839 --> 24:53.440
What harm to let them run up a score?

405
24:53.440 --> 24:55.119
As the debt mounts,

406
24:55.119 --> 24:57.200
we may claim repayment in due time.

407
24:57.200 --> 24:59.119
Yet you insisted on meddling.

408
24:59.119 --> 25:00.839
Right now, it's barely 1,000 taels.

409
25:00.839 --> 25:02.940
At worst, his father shall only beat him.

410
25:07.119 --> 25:08.700
What a pity.

411
25:14.319 --> 25:16.680
I didn't realize you hold such a grudge.

412
25:16.680 --> 25:18.240
Settling all old scores.

413
25:18.240 --> 25:19.519
Aren't you the same?

414
25:19.519 --> 25:20.720
What?

415
25:20.720 --> 25:22.539
Settling all old scores.

416
25:23.559 --> 25:25.059
What does that mean?

417
25:26.519 --> 25:28.259
Get me that twig.

418
25:46.182 --> 25:48.759
[Ya Zi Bi Bao]

419
25:48.759 --> 25:51.519
"Ya" is the eye socket. "Zi" is the corner of the eye.

420
25:51.519 --> 25:52.960
At first, it meant to glare at someone.

421
25:52.960 --> 25:54.839
Now it speaks of even the smallest wrong,

422
25:54.839 --> 25:59.079
and how every grudge, big or small, must be settled.

423
25:59.079 --> 26:02.140
Then what about my name?

424
26:04.148 --> 26:06.360
Your name?

425
26:06.360 --> 26:07.640
Watch.

426
26:07.640 --> 26:09.140
Jin.

427
26:16.200 --> 26:17.779
Bao.

428
26:21.519 --> 26:23.019
Zhu.

429
26:25.982 --> 26:28.539
"Zhu" means "swine", an animal to be slaughtered?

430
26:29.599 --> 26:31.640
Not anymore.

431
26:31.640 --> 26:33.140
Then what is it?

432
26:46.609 --> 26:49.680
[Pearl]

433
26:49.680 --> 26:53.559
From now on, it means the "pearl", a treasure to be cherished.

434
26:53.559 --> 26:55.440
What?

435
26:55.440 --> 26:56.940
A treasure to be cherished.

436
27:00.200 --> 27:02.079
It refers to the jewelry.

437
27:02.079 --> 27:04.779
I like this one! I love its meaning!

438
27:07.960 --> 27:11.119
Xie Yan, could you teach me to read and write?

439
27:11.119 --> 27:13.180
Never again shall I suffer the mockery of others.

440
27:15.119 --> 27:17.640
If you teach me, I'll help you too.

441
27:17.640 --> 27:18.720
How can you help me?

442
27:18.720 --> 27:20.700
I can help you live a better life in the Xie family.

443
27:26.480 --> 27:28.299
What makes a better life?

444
27:28.920 --> 27:30.119
I don't know.

445
27:30.119 --> 27:32.279
Yet I know your days are hard.

446
27:32.279 --> 27:35.599
Our account books were torn, but we do not know who did it,

447
27:35.599 --> 27:37.539
nor can we punish the culprit.

448
27:38.279 --> 27:41.680
Withered grass in your courtyard grows so tall.

449
27:41.680 --> 27:43.119
Passing the Second Branch's courtyard,

450
27:43.119 --> 27:45.539
I saw their grounds heavy with blossoms.

451
27:47.720 --> 27:48.960
Will you teach me?

452
27:48.960 --> 27:50.539
I learn swiftly.

453
27:58.440 --> 28:00.980
Yes, I'll teach you.

454
28:03.039 --> 28:05.180
Wonderful!

455
28:06.440 --> 28:08.700
- Let's go! - Slow down.

456
28:10.599 --> 28:12.039
Slow down.

457
28:12.039 --> 28:15.559
I'm no longer a swine born to be eaten!

458
28:15.559 --> 28:17.240
Gently now.

459
28:17.240 --> 28:20.680
- I'm born to be treasured. - Slow down.

460
28:20.680 --> 28:23.079
I'm born to be treasured.

461
28:23.079 --> 28:24.740
Slow down.

462
28:26.359 --> 28:28.220
As you wish.

463
28:30.359 --> 28:32.359
- Stop running! - I know I was wrong, Father!

464
28:32.359 --> 28:34.480
[Dedicated to Public Service] Don't run! Lu Zi Yu, stop right there!

465
28:34.480 --> 28:35.519
Do not dare take one more step!

466
28:35.519 --> 28:36.960
I have settled my portion!

467
28:36.960 --> 28:38.839
The young men of Bai and Huang clans spent the most,

468
28:38.839 --> 28:39.920
with but a little left unpaid.

469
28:39.920 --> 28:41.759
Still remains unpaid?

470
28:41.759 --> 28:43.519
- Father! - Stop!

471
28:43.519 --> 28:44.720
- You wretch! - Don't worry!

472
28:44.720 --> 28:46.759
Stop right there!

473
28:46.759 --> 28:48.480
Father, are you unharmed?

474
28:48.480 --> 28:49.480
Don't worry.

475
28:49.480 --> 28:50.960
I shall assuredly recover the money.

476
28:50.960 --> 28:52.759
You need not trouble yourself further.

477
28:52.759 --> 28:54.759
Keep your hands off me!

478
28:54.759 --> 28:58.799
You wretch! My yearly stipend is but 800 taels!

479
28:58.799 --> 28:59.799
[Lu Xian] Look what you've done!

480
28:59.799 --> 29:01.864
[River Sub-Prefect of Yangzhou Prefecture] Spending 1,000 taels of silver

481
29:01.864 --> 29:02.864
just to settle the debts!

482
29:02.864 --> 29:05.599
If word of this reaches outsiders,

483
29:05.599 --> 29:07.440
how can they not suspect me?

484
29:07.440 --> 29:10.920
How could I have fathered such a wretched boy as you?

485
29:10.920 --> 29:12.359
At times,

486
29:12.359 --> 29:13.720
I long to strike my own face!

487
29:13.720 --> 29:15.319
Father!

488
29:15.319 --> 29:16.799
Rest easy.

489
29:16.799 --> 29:20.319
Like father, like son. Vermin breeds vermin!

490
29:20.319 --> 29:21.480
Say that again?

491
29:21.480 --> 29:23.039
Say that again!

492
29:23.039 --> 29:24.200
Not again! Father!

493
29:24.200 --> 29:25.880
Stop right there!

494
29:25.880 --> 29:27.440
Father!

495
29:27.440 --> 29:29.420
[Xie Manor] Stop chasing me, Father!

496
29:33.559 --> 29:35.059
Ying Tao.

497
29:35.799 --> 29:37.299
Ying Tao.

498
29:38.599 --> 29:40.720
What can I do for you, Lady Jin?

499
29:40.720 --> 29:44.279
How do the scions of the Xie family live in comfort,

500
29:44.279 --> 29:46.119
enjoy fine food and clad in gold and silver?

501
29:46.119 --> 29:47.960
That depends on their rank title.

502
29:47.960 --> 29:50.039
The higher their rank, the better their life.

503
29:50.039 --> 29:51.759
Rank title? What's that?

504
29:51.759 --> 29:54.279
The Xie clan has over 300 members.

505
29:54.279 --> 29:56.119
There are innumerable affairs to attend to.

506
29:56.119 --> 29:57.599
For orderly governance,

507
29:57.599 --> 29:59.960
duties fall into 16 divisions.

508
29:59.960 --> 30:01.680
Each division has a steward,

509
30:01.680 --> 30:04.200
ranked by task gravity and urgency.

510
30:04.200 --> 30:06.701
Their rank is set by 16 characters: Heaven, Earth, Dark, Yellow,

511
30:06.701 --> 30:08.443
Yu, Zhou, Hong, Huang,

512
30:08.443 --> 30:10.759
Sun, Moon, Wax, Wane, Chen, Xiu, Lie, Zhang.

513
30:10.759 --> 30:12.519
One character is allotted to each steward

514
30:12.519 --> 30:14.779
for their rank title.

515
30:15.480 --> 30:16.720
Heaven, Earth, Dark, Yellow?

516
30:16.720 --> 30:20.240
These words depict the look of heaven and earth.

517
30:20.240 --> 30:22.759
Heaven is dark azure, and the earth is yellow.

518
30:22.759 --> 30:23.839
Yu, Zhou, Hong, Huang.

519
30:23.839 --> 30:25.119
"Yu" denotes the six spatial directions.

520
30:25.119 --> 30:26.599
"Zhou" is all time from antiquity to now.

521
30:26.599 --> 30:29.240
"Hong Huang" means the primeval chaos of heaven's first separation from earth.

522
30:29.240 --> 30:31.279
Sun, Moon, Wax, Wane, Chen, Xiu, Lie, Zhang.

523
30:31.279 --> 30:32.799
It denotes the sun's rise and fall,

524
30:32.799 --> 30:34.359
the moon's wax and wane,

525
30:34.359 --> 30:36.759
stars and constellations arrayed in the firmament.

526
30:36.759 --> 30:39.759
Ying Tao, you know much!

527
30:39.759 --> 30:41.400
You honor me, Lady Jin.

528
30:41.400 --> 30:43.759
I tended to the Matriarch day by day

529
30:43.759 --> 30:45.579
and learned it gradually.

530
30:46.200 --> 30:48.359
By seniority and station,

531
30:48.359 --> 30:50.799
is the Matriarch the "Heaven" of the Xie family?

532
30:50.799 --> 30:52.279
Indeed.

533
30:52.279 --> 30:54.519
The Matriarch presides over the clan's canal shipping undertaking.

534
30:54.519 --> 30:56.519
She is most revered.

535
30:56.519 --> 30:59.279
What about... my husband?

536
30:59.279 --> 31:02.119
Master Yan is of the "Huang" rank.

537
31:02.119 --> 31:04.259
His duty is to compile canonical works.

538
31:05.200 --> 31:07.720
He is ranked eighth. Quite respectable.

539
31:07.720 --> 31:09.480
Though the title sounds a bit bleak.

540
31:09.480 --> 31:11.200
There is more to this matter, Lady Jin.

541
31:11.200 --> 31:13.279
The conferral of these ranks adheres to strict rules.

542
31:13.279 --> 31:15.519
The first eight ranks must be filled by direct clan kin,

543
31:15.519 --> 31:18.440
who oversee critical canal shipping and core manor affairs.

544
31:18.440 --> 31:20.220
So he's at the very bottom?

545
31:22.000 --> 31:24.240
Matron Fang asked you to report to Grandmother.

546
31:24.240 --> 31:25.740
Right now.

547
31:30.759 --> 31:33.279
Ying Tao, stay.

548
31:33.279 --> 31:35.039
I need another hand.

549
31:35.039 --> 31:36.960
Jian Wei is utterly exhausted these days.

550
31:36.960 --> 31:38.460
So you come lend a hand.

551
31:39.519 --> 31:40.519
I am not weary.

552
31:40.519 --> 31:43.019
To serve Master is my blessing.

553
31:44.519 --> 31:48.299
Why tear pages from the account book then?
